    "body": "> * I think we should not include the clamping/nesting behavior of `setTimeout()`, although I'm open to being persuaded otherwise.\r\n\r\nWe're trying to reduce the amount of code that executes in the background, and throttling/clamping is part of that. Wouldn't this just become a way to work around it? https://developer.chrome.com/blog/timer-throttling-in-chrome-88/",
