    "updated_at": "2021-11-16T17:47:59Z",
    "body": "Would definitely be +1 on having this as proposed. It would be slightly better if we had ways of refreshing and canceling the timeout once created... e.g for example:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst signal = AbortSignal.timeout(1000);\r\n\r\n// wait a few milliseconds somehow... then reset the timout timer.\r\n\r\nsignal.timeout(1000);\r\n\r\n// or cancel the timeout entirely and clear the internal timer\r\nsignal.timeout(0);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis would allow me to easily use this for idle-timeouts.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
